  "goodToKnow": "Die Todesursache is the cause of death: die Todesursache ermitteln, natürliche Todesursache. In Germany, cardiovascular diseases (Herz-Kreislauf-Erkrankungen) are the most common cause of death, followed by cancer (Krebs). A doctor must issue a Totenschein (death certificate) stating the cause; unclear cases lead to an Obduktion (autopsy). Die Ursache means cause. Plural: die Todesursachen."
